**Example usage**
```tsx
<CheckoutPage
  items={[
    { id: "1", name: "Wireless Headphones", unitPrice: 79.99, quantity: 1 },
    { id: "2", name: "USB-C Cable", unitPrice: 9.99, quantity: 2 },
  ]}
  currency="USD"
  onBackToCart={() => navigate("/cart")}
  onPay={(address) => {
    console.log("Paying with address:", address);
  }}
/>
```

The component is props-driven (cart items, submit state, and callbacks come from the parent), so it plugs into whatever routing/state management the app already uses.
